OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787093266
OL,3,CUK responds to Russia's threat of
OL,4,C'consequences' over alleged use of
OL,5,Cdrones
OL,7,FMoscow has threatened the UK with
OL,8,F"consequences" after reports that
OL,9,FBritish drones have been used to
OL,10,Fstrike targets on Russia's mainland
OL,11,Ffor the first time.
OL,13,FUkraine used drones made by two UK
OL,14,Fcompanies as part of a so-called deep
OL,15,Fstrike campaign, the Sunday Times
OL,16,Freported.
OL,18,FThe Ministry of Defence (MOD)
OL,19,Fresponded to Russia's warning on
OL,20,FMonday night, saying: "Britain stands
OL,21,Fshoulder to shoulder with Ukraine."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
