OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787093266
OL,3,CUK responds to Russia's threat of
OL,4,C'consequences' over alleged use of
OL,5,Cdrones
OL,7,FKyiv has stepped up its attacks on
OL,8,FRussia this year, with long-range
OL,9,Fmissiles and swarms of drones
OL,10,Fincreasingly targeting military
OL,11,Findustries and energy facilities.
OL,13,FIt has also targeted giant depots for
OL,14,FWildberries ` Russia's largest online
OL,15,Fretailer ` burning billions of pounds
OL,16,Fof merchandise and bringing the war
OL,17,Fhome to the Russian public more than
OL,18,Ffour years into Moscow's full-scale
OL,19,Finvasion of Ukraine.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787093266
OL,3,CUK responds to Russia's threat of
OL,4,C'consequences' over alleged use of
OL,5,Cdrones
OL,7,FRussia's embassy to the UK said in a
OL,8,Fstatement on Monday that the reports
OL,9,F"confirm that London is deliberately
OL,10,Fopting for an escalation of the
OL,11,FUkraine crisis", accusing Britain of
OL,12,F"seeking to contain Russia and inflict
OL,13,Fmaximum damage on it by proxy".
OL,15,F"London's actions will inevitably
OL,16,Fcarry consequences for which it will
OL,17,Fhave to answer," it added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787093266
OL,3,CUK responds to Russia's threat of
OL,4,C'consequences' over alleged use of
OL,5,Cdrones
OL,7,F"The deeper its involvement in the
OL,8,Fconflict and the greater its support
OL,9,Ffor Kyiv's terrorist machinery, the
OL,10,Fhigher the price it will pay."
OL,12,FAn MOD spokesperson said: "Britain
OL,13,Fstands shoulder to shoulder with
OL,14,FUkraine and we are committed to
OL,15,Fproviding the equipment Ukraine needs
OL,16,Fto defend itself against Putin's
OL,17,Fillegal invasion.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787093266
OL,3,CUK responds to Russia's threat of
OL,4,C'consequences' over alleged use of
OL,5,Cdrones
OL,7,F"Russia should be in no doubt about
OL,8,Fthe resolve of this Government to
OL,9,Fstand against Russian aggression, in
OL,10,FUkraine and against the UK and our
OL,11,Fallies."
OL,13,FUkraine's strategy of long-range drone
OL,14,Fstrikes is believed to be aimed at
OL,15,Fcutting Moscow's revenue for the war
OL,16,Fand making Russian citizens feel the
OL,17,Fimpact of the invasion.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
