OL,3,CUK responds to Russia's threat of
OL,4,C'consequences' over alleged use of
OL,5,Cdrones
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,10,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
OL,12,FIt launched three times as many of
OL,13,Fthose strikes in July as it did in
OL,14,FJanuary, according to data from Acled,
OL,15,Fan independent conflict monitor.
OL,17,FRepeatedly hitting deep into Russia
OL,18,Fhas forced its military to stretch air
OL,19,Fdefences over a larger area.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
