CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787093266
OL,3,CUK responds to Russia's threat of
OL,4,C'consequences' over alleged use of
OL,5,Cdrones
OL,7,FRussia's Ministry of Defence said on
OL,8,FSaturday that it had shot down 598
OL,9,FUkrainian drones over 19 Russian
OL,10,Fregions, as well as the Black and Azov
OL,11,FSeas and the annexed Ukrainian
OL,12,Fpeninsula of Crimea.
OL,14,FOfficials on Monday said Ukrainian
OL,15,Flong-range attacks on Russia killed
OL,16,Fseven people overnight, while five
OL,17,Fcivilians died in Ukraine after
OL,18,Fstrikes by Moscow's forces.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
